# Releases do not upload an image

A release is the pull request, the tag, and the GitHub release notes.
Do not wait on GitHub Actions. Local `scripts/ci-check.sh` is the check
that already ran on the push.

Do not start `scripts/iso-release.sh`. Do not upload an image, sign a
checksum for upload, or copy a deploy key into a release worktree.

The image, when one is asked for, is only for testing the Calamares
installer and the boot. Build it locally with
`scripts/iso-build.sh --mkarchiso` and leave it on disk. Do not attach
it. Do not start that build during ordinary development.
